 ## Troubleshooting
 
 The common failures (tag drift, wrong image name or registry, unavailable `RUN`, no daemon on the build host, insecure registry rejection, multi-RID publish races, and multi-target publishing) are covered in depth in [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md). In short: set your tag (`ContainerImageTag` or `ContainerImageTags`) explicitly, set `ContainerRepository` and `ContainerRegistry` explicitly, and use `ContainerArchiveOutputPath` when no daemon is available.
 
 ### Tag drift
 
 **Symptom:** Your pipeline publishes an image but you cannot find the version you expect, only `latest`.
